### Issue Description

Unknown registry key in ResourceKey[minecraft:root / minecraft:recipe_serializer]: bookshelf:shapeless_durability

I even tried example datapack recipe in docs to ensure it wasn't user error. Bookshelf is installed and updated, and Botany Pots is working just fine.

Example recipe I used:
```
{
  "type": "bookshelf:shapeless_durability",
  "damageAmount": 1,
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "item": "minecraft:shears"
    },
    {
      "item": "minecraft:book"
    }
  ],
  "result": {
    "item": "minecraft:paper"
  }
}
```

